notes:
PRONUNCIATION:
じっぷん is also correct; じゅっぷん is the more common reading today.

WATCH OUT:
{十分|じゅうぶん} ("enough, sufficient") is written the same way. Read it from context: {十分|じゅっぷん}⟦{待|ま}つ→待つ：00469_matsu⟧ (wait ten minutes) vs. {十分|じゅうぶん}⟦{待|ま}った→待つ：00469_matsu⟧ (waited long enough).

